id: pm-ts-starter-jwgz
title: "Certify pm CLI 2026.9.21 and move onto the canonical pm-ops merge-driver, lint and duplication gates"
description: "Fleet wave of 2026-09-22 (companion epic pm-cli-website-5s6z): this repo is pinned to @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.17, pm-ops 2026.9.13 and pm-changelog 2026.9.16 while 2026.9.21, 2026.9.18 and 2026.9.18 are published. Repin all three exactly, absorb Dependabot PR #107 (@types/node 26.6.1), replace the vendored scripts/prepare-merge-driver.ts with the thin pm-ops/merge-driver launcher and add the pm merge install step before pm health --strict-exit --require-merge-drivers in CI, and adopt the canonical pm-ops/eslint and pm-ops/duplication gates with a thin scripts/lint.ts and scripts/duplication-gate.ts launcher, wiring both into release:check and CI and fixing every finding in code. Delivers the remaining lint and duplication halves of pm-ts-starter-s2kh."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: certify,multi-agent,pm-cli-2026.9.21,quality
created_at: "2026-09-22T04:54:13.423Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-22T05:59:45.980Z"
closed_at: "2026-09-22T05:00:28.750Z"
completed_at: "2026-09-22T05:00:28.750Z"
author: pi-agent
acceptance_criteria: "package.json and package-lock.json pin @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.21, pm-changelog 2026.9.18 and pm-ops 2026.9.18 exactly, with Dependabot PR #107's @types/node 26.6.1 bump absorbed; scripts/prepare-merge-driver.ts is the thin pm-ops/merge-driver launcher; npm ci registers the merge drivers and CI runs ./node_modules/.bin/pm merge install before ./node_modules/.bin/pm health --strict-exit --require-merge-drivers; scripts/lint.ts and scripts/duplication-gate.ts are thin launchers over pm-ops/eslint and pm-ops/duplication; release:check and CI run npm run lint and npm run duplication; every lint and duplication finding is fixed in code, not suppressed; Coverage thresholds stay at 100/100/100 and the measured numbers do not drop; npm run release:check exits 0"
resolution: "All three pins certified, the vendored merge-driver hook replaced by the canonical pm-ops/merge-driver launcher with CI merge-driver install + require-merge-drivers health, and the canonical lint and duplication gates adopted and green."
expected_result: "package.json and package-lock.json pin pm CLI 2026.9.21 / pm-changelog 2026.9.18 / pm-ops 2026.9.18; npm run lint and npm run duplication exit 0 with every finding fixed in code; coverage stays 100/100/100 and npm run release:check exits 0."
actual_result: Pins verified by reading both files back; lint measured 1 error -> 0 (EXIT=0); duplication measured 3.09% / 23 clone pairs -> 0.00% / 0 pairs (EXIT=0); coverage 100/100/100 (EXIT=0); pm health --strict-exit --require-merge-drivers EXIT=0; 178/178 tests pass.
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-22T05:59:45.980Z",fleet-wave-script,"Review follow-up (Greptile P1 + Sourcery on pm-starter#113): the launcher statically imports the devDependency pm-ops, so the README's promise that production / --omit=dev installs cannot break held only for registry installs, which never run prepare. README now states the real contract: a production install of a clone must pass --ignore-scripts. Canonical guarded launcher tracked as companion item pm-cli-website-xy19."
