tests[1]{command,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  "npm run release:check",project,pi-agent,"2026-09-22T05:00:14.034Z",local_mutation,pm-cli-2026-9-21-canonical-pm-ops-gates
close_reason: "Delivered on branch pm-cli-2026-9-21-canonical-pm-ops-gates. Pins: package.json + package-lock.json now carry @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.21, pm-changelog 2026.9.18, pm-ops 2026.9.18 exactly (read back from both files), plus the canonical gate devDependencies @babel/eslint-parser ^8.0.5, @babel/plugin-syntax-typescript ^8.0.3, eslint ^10.10.0, fast-glob ^3.3.3, jscpd ^4.3.0. Dependabot #107 absorbed: lockfile @types/node bumped to 26.6.1 within the unchanged ^26.2.0 range (verified in package-lock.json; npm update first overshot to 26.6.2, forced back to the proposed 26.6.1). Merge driver: scripts/prepare-merge-driver.ts replaced by the thin pm-ops/merge-driver launcher (git config --get-regexp '^merge.pm' lists all five drivers after npm ci); CI now runs ./node_modules/.bin/pm merge install before ./node_modules/.bin/pm health --strict-exit --require-merge-drivers (measured EXIT=0). Lint + duplication: thin launchers scripts/lint.ts and scripts/duplication-gate.ts over pm-ops/eslint and pm-ops/duplication, wired into release:check (right after typecheck) and CI. Measured before the fix: lint 1 error (no-duplicate-imports in test/smoke.test.ts), duplication 3.09% / 23 clone pairs (199/6440 lines). Measured after: npm run lint EXIT=0 (0 findings), npm run duplication EXIT=0 (0.00% / 0 clone pairs, 0/6022 lines); every finding fixed in code via shared helpers (setUpPmWorkspace, withFakePmOnPath, runSetupWizard, assertAllHooksQuiet, runPassThroughPreflightOverride in smoke; createGateFixture and friends in coverage-gate.test.ts), no eslint-disable, no ignores added, threshold 0 / minTokens 50 unchanged. Suite: 178 tests pass (old vendored merge-driver tests deleted per the canonical-export policy; 193 -> 178). Coverage gate: 100/100/100 lines/branches/functions across index.ts + scripts/coverage-gate.ts + scripts/docstring-gate.ts + scripts/prepare-merge-driver.ts, EXIT=0. Docstring gate EXIT=0 (9 files, 20 declarations). pm health --strict-exit --require-merge-drivers EXIT=0."
body: ""
